      "evidence": [25, 26, 27, 34],
      "text": "User locomotion in virtual reality (VR), which is closely related to matched motion, is moving oneself in the virtual world while one's physical motion in the real world is not matched; it is motivated because users often want to move well outside the matched zone."
    },
    {
      "evidence": [31],
